out.push(A('⚠ **The pauses are the point and they are audible from the back.** **Read _the second count has not been done_ flat and inside its sentence, then read it again as three parts with a pause before and after.** **The room will say _confession_ or _apology_ without being prompted.** **Then say why it matters at C1 and not before: a hedge delivered as a confession invites comfort**, and a reader who has been invited to comfort you has stopped reading the document. **It is the spoken version of the cushion from 2.1 and the class should be told they are the same fault.**'));
