  '**Method.** **Forty-one consecutive admissions were identified from the admissions book and not from the laboratory record.** **It was recorded for each admission whether a second sample had been taken before antibiotics were started.** **Thirty-one had; ten had not.** **Results were retrieved for thirty-eight; three sets from 2023 are not in the system.**',
