out.push(A('⚠ **The single pause is the whole of the pronunciation point and it is easy to hear.** **Read a _what_-clause as one block with one pause before _is_, then read it again with a pause in the middle.** **The room says what the second reading did: it made them start the sentence again.** **Then the useful observation: students put that second pause in because the clause feels long**, and the cure is not to shorten it but to read it faster. **A twenty-word subject said in one breath is ordinary; the same subject said in two is a stammer.**'));
