out.push(A('**294 words, three actions in the first five lines including a verb for the reader who will not telephone, a closed set of courses, the facts in the middle for the reader who cannot ask, and the writer\'s own paragraph last and labelled.** ⚠ **The clause that earns the band is _and should note that no certificate has been issued for this frame at any stage._** **It is written for a man who will read it in eighteen months**, and it is the only sentence in the letter whose reader has not yet been appointed.'));
