out.push(A('⚠ **Three readings aloud and a stopping point declared each time, and this is the only proof-reading in the unit that produces a change on the spot.** **Most people stop twice in the first paragraph and once at the end.** **Have each student say where they stopped, out loud, before anybody comments.** **Then one instruction: anything important below your lowest stopping point moves.** ⚠ **Expect two or three students to move a paragraph during the stage**, which has not happened at any earlier point in this course, **and say that it is the ordinary way a C1 writer edits: not by rereading the page but by reading it as the person who will not finish it.**'));
