out.push(A('⚠ **Item 4 is the one that separates a class**: **_claimant_ is a person and about a third of any room writes it**, because it is the commoner word in official prose. **Teach the two-second check: read the whole sentence back with the built word in place.** **And item 8 is the collocation** — _sat badly with_ **is the declared item from this unit\'s list**, and it takes the past because the rest of the sentence does.'));
out.push(A('**B  Listening** **1** fair   **2** reads it   **3** subject   **4** about two thirds   **5** four   **6** first paragraph   **7** a verb   **8** not at fault'));
out.push(A('⚠ **Part 2 is sentence completion and the answers are in the recording, in the recording\'s own words, in order.** **Two things lose marks and neither is comprehension.** **The first is writing more than three words** — item 4 is _about two thirds_ and a candidate who writes _about two thirds of them had more than one reader_ has written the sentence twice. **The second is paraphrasing**: item 2 is _reads it_ and _nobody looks at it_ is wrong, **although it is what the speaker means.** **Say so once, here, and the class will stop losing marks for being helpful.**'));
